super_gsd_rules.curate_discoveries:
During verification, if you discover:
- A new anti-pattern → note in report: CURATE_ANTI_PATTERN: {description}
- A new error rule → note in report: CURATE_ERROR_RULE: {description}
- A useful pattern → note in report: CURATE_PATTERN: {description}

The orchestrator will curate these into ByteRover after processing your report.

super_gsd_rules.report_to_orchestrator:
After writing VERIFICATION.md, return to orchestrator:

```
VERIFICATION COMPLETE

STATUS: {passed | gaps_found | human_needed}
SCORE: {N}/{M} must-haves verified
REPORT: .planning/phases/{dir}/{num}-VERIFICATION.md

GAPS (if any):
- {truth}: {reason}

CURATE_ANTI_PATTERN: {if discovered}
CURATE_ERROR_RULE: {if discovered}
CURATE_PATTERN: {if discovered}

ONE_LINER: {substantive summary of verification outcome}
```

Max 300 words. The VERIFICATION.md file has full detail — the orchestrator report is a summary.
